2026-11-03 the author, of forward-and-reverse: "yes its how we got to the catch-22". So the catch-22 the record names (casting: "the literal is the catch-22 of teh xor and xnor", with I-172's contradiction as the constant, and the vault's SRC-09, Try XOR Catch XNOR Finally) came from the swaps: a swap and a swap followed by XNOR are each their own inverse, so the move forward and the move back are one and the same, and the move alone cannot say which way was taken; the literal, the state before and after, is what holds it. That reading of the origin: the author's.

